{"file":"maisecrets-0.5.9-v1.zip","bytes":279452,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"maisecrets","displayName":"maisecrets","description":"Intercepts detected secrets and PII before they reach the cloud model: deterministic detection, a local vault with TTL, placeholders resolved only where the real call happens. Free and open source, by mcpgate.de.","version":"0.5.9","license":"Apache-2.0","repository":"https://github.com/Mcpgate-de/maisecrets","homepage":"https://maisecrets.dev","keywords":["security","privacy","secrets","pii","redaction","vault"]},{"path":".codex-plugin/plugin.json","name":"maisecrets","description":"Intercepts detected secrets and PII before they reach the cloud model: deterministic detection, a local vault with TTL, placeholders resolved only where the real call happens. Free and open source, by mcpgate.de.","version":"0.5.9","license":"Apache-2.0","repository":"https://github.com/Mcpgate-de/maisecrets","homepage":"https://maisecrets.dev","keywords":["security","privacy","secrets","pii","redaction","vault"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/secret-hygiene/SKILL.md","name":"secret-hygiene","description":"Protect secrets from the AI and clean up those that already leaked. Use when the user wants to protect passwords, keys or personal data from the AI or to install maisecrets; when the user asks whether a repository, its git history, a file or their past AI agent sessions contain passwords, API keys, tokens or private keys; when the user says a key or password was pasted into a chat, committed, pushed, logged or shared; or when the user wants a log, config or stack trace made safe to post in an issue, ticket or chat. Never shows a secret value.","headings":["Secret hygiene","First: is the protection active?","Install the protection","Rules for every task","Check a repository","Check what the AI agents already received","Contain a leak","Make a file safe to share"],"name_hint":"secret · hygiene","description_zh":"保护密码、密钥和个人数据不暴露给AI，支持安装maisecrets、检查仓库历史与过去会话中的泄露、处理已分享密钥，以及脱敏日志配置和堆栈；原说明明确不显示秘密值。"}],"commands":[{"path":"commands/audit.md","name":"audit","description":"The last resolves - when, which session, which key, which tool, the command with its placeholders. Values are never in this log.","headings":[]},{"path":"commands/forget.md","name":"forget","description":"Delete stored values by key, for example /maisecrets:forget SECRET_c3. A placeholder for a deleted key no longer resolves.","headings":[]},{"path":"commands/list.md","name":"list","description":"Show what maisecrets keeps on this computer - each stored value in its masked form, its type, age, uses and when it expires. No value is printed.","headings":[]},{"path":"commands/put.md","name":"put","description":"Store the value in your clipboard in the maisecrets vault and get a placeholder back (for a password without a recognisable shape). The value never reaches the model.","headings":[]},{"path":"commands/report.md","name":"report","description":"Report to the maisecrets maintainers - a false positive (last detection), a bug, or a feature request. Prints the issue text and a prefilled link; --create files it with the GitHub CLI. Carries no value.","headings":[]},{"path":"commands/send.md","name":"send","description":"Send the last blocked prompt as maisecrets rewrote it (placeholders instead of values). No copying, works over SSH and in Remote Control.","headings":[]},{"path":"commands/shortcut.md","name":"shortcut","description":"Install a short personal /ms command for /maisecrets:send (works over SSH and in Remote Control).","headings":[]},{"path":"commands/status.md","name":"status","description":"Show what maisecrets is and does on this machine - version, plugin folder, Python, store, policy, counts. No value is printed.","headings":[]}],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["maisecrets","What it looks like","Status","Client support","Requirements","Install","Update and uninstall","For administrators","What t